@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Run all requests in this file from top to bottom to create the required data and test the content endpoints.
### Create category first (use generated ID for content creation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "content-category-{{$timestamp}}",
  "description": "Category for content API example"
}
> {% client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.id); %}

### Create author first (use generated ID for content creation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Content API author",
  "email": "content-author-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "change-me-123"
}
> {% client.global.set("authorId", response.body.id); %}

### Create content (201); subsequent requests use generated ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"REST API practice","description":"Spring Boot CRUD","authorId":{{authorId}},"categoryId":{{categoryId}}}
> {% client.global.set("contentId", response.body.id); %}

### List contents (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contents

### Read content (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}

### Replace title and description (PUT requires both, 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Updated REST API","description":"Updated description"}

### Patch title only (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Patched title"}

### Empty patch (400, INVALID_CONTENT_PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Blank title (400, INVALID_REQUEST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":" ","description":"Description","authorId":{{authorId}},"categoryId":{{categoryId}}}

### Missing description (400, INVALID_REQUEST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Missing description","authorId":{{authorId}},"categoryId":{{categoryId}}}

### Missing authorId (400, INVALID_REQUEST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Missing author","description":"Description","categoryId":{{categoryId}}}

### Missing categoryId (400, INVALID_REQUEST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contents
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Missing category","description":"Description","authorId":{{authorId}}}

### Missing content (404, CONTENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/999999999

### Delete content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/contents/{{contentId}}
